  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-adult-art-medication-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-adult-art-medication-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-adult-art-medication-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-dtg-300-300-50\">adult-tdf-3tc-dtg-300-300-50</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 300/300/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-efv-300-300-400\">adult-tdf-3tc-efv-300-300-400</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Efavirenz 300/300/400 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-taf-ftc-dtg-25-200-50\">adult-taf-ftc-dtg-25-200-50</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tenofovir alafenamide/Emtricitabine/Dolutegravir 25/200/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-taf-3tc-dtg-25-300-50\">adult-taf-3tc-dtg-25-300-50</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tenofovir alafenamide/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 25/300/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-abc-3tc-600-300\">adult-abc-3tc-600-300</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Abacavir/Lamivudine 600/300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-azt-3tc-300-150\">adult-azt-3tc-300-150</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Zidovudine/Lamivudine 300/150 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-tdf-3tc-300-300\">adult-tdf-3tc-300-300</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tenofovir/Lamivudine 300/300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-azt-300\">adult-azt-300</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Zidovudine 300 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-atv-r-300-100\">adult-atv-r-300-100</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Atazanavir/Ritonavir 300/100 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-3tc-150\">adult-3tc-150</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Lamivudine 150 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-drv-600\">adult-drv-600</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Darunavir 600 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-rtv-100\">adult-rtv-100</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Ritonavir 100 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-drv-r-400-50\">adult-drv-r-400-50</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Darunavir/Ritonavir 400/50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form preprints twice-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-adult-dtg-50\">adult-dtg-50</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Dolutegravir 50 mg</td><td>Adult ART formulation. The source form permits once- or twice-daily frequency.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
